{"type":"message","id":"3cc64064","parentId":"43e48b16","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:57:52.505Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-02-18 18:27 GMT+5:30] You are the OSINT Analyst. Conduct a thorough analysis of the OpenClaw project: its GitHub repository (stars, forks, recent activity, issues, PRs), documentation quality, community engagement (Discord, discussions), and any security advisories or vulnerabilities. Also check online mentions, tutorials, and third-party integrations. Provide a concise intelligence report with findings, risks, and opportunities. Use web search and fetch tools as needed."}],"timestamp":1771419472500}}
{"type":"message","id":"921eed0e","parentId":"3cc64064","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:57:56.601Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to conduct a thorough analysis of the OpenClaw project as an OSINT analyst. I need to:\n\n1. Analyze GitHub repository (stars, forks, recent activity, issues, PRs)\n2. Check documentation quality\n3. Community engagement (Discord, discussions)\n4. Security advisories or vulnerabilities\n5. Online mentions, tutorials, and third-party integrations\n6. Provide a concise intelligence report with findings, risks, and opportunities\n\nLet me start by gathering information. I'll use web_search and web_fetch tools to collect data.\n\nFirst, I should search for the OpenClaw project to understand what it is and find its GitHub repository.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll conduct a thorough OSINT analysis of the OpenClaw project. Let me start by searching for information about the project and its GitHub repository."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a2c63de0af4e41309d177609","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"OpenClaw GitHub repository project","count":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":9703,"output":376,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10079,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771419472505}}
